=== base ===
# Marketing Services Agreement

This Agreement is made between Brackenridge Creative Ltd (the "Agency") and Pollard Leisure Parks Ltd (the "Client").

## 1. Services
1.1 The Agency shall deliver four campaign concepts each quarter.
1.2 The Client shall pay a quarterly fee of £18,000.
1.3 The Agency shall attend a monthly review meeting at the Client's offices.
=== amendment ===
# Amended and Restated Marketing Services Agreement

This Agreement is made on 1 July 2027 between Brackenridge Creative Ltd (the "Agency") and Pollard Leisure Parks Ltd (the "Client") and amends and restates the Marketing Services Agreement in its entirety.

## 1. Services
1.1 The Agency shall deliver four campaign concepts each quarter.
1.2 The Client shall pay a quarterly fee of £21,500.
